334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810210/extras/ba847c36e1092283248b889281f9a026.webm?t=1786807874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810210/extras/ba847c36e1092283248b889281f9a026.mp4?t=1786807874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple infected enemy types; battle against a variety of terrifying enemies, from commons and fallen soldiers to feral zombie dogs, adapting the gameplay as you fight the infestation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive gore system; making neutralising enemies feel truly satisfying, featuring full dismemberment, body deformation and multilayered damage systems, and even having their clothes and flesh burn away when lit on fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your soldier; stand out in the field with a variety of uniforms, helmets and gloves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810210/extras/0817ca2edecfcdc9abddba342bfc94ec.poster.avif?t=1786807874\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810210/extras/0817ca2edecfcdc9abddba342bfc94ec.webm?t=1786807874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810210/extras/0817ca2edecfcdc9abddba342bfc94ec.mp4?t=1786807874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your arsenal with various new weapons, and equip skins on our wide arsenal of weapons, to slaughter your enemies in style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recoup and plan your missions back at CURE HQ, where you and your squad can gear up, try out new weapons, customization, and track your progress climbing the ranks between missions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through fully procedural maps, made out of tilesets featuring a wide variety of diverse locations. Every mission is guaranteed to be a unique experience!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810210/extras/f38d073a96229bc37238756477772267.poster.avif?t=1786807874\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810210/extras/f38d073a96229bc37238756477772267.webm?t=1786807874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810210/extras/f38d073a96229bc37238756477772267.mp4?t=1786807874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Codename CURE II is a co-operative first person shooter set in the aftermath of a zombie apocalypse. Create an elite military squad with up to five players and fight your way through hordes of zombies in a variety of dynamic objective missions.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Hungarian, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish, Ukrainian, Italian, Romanian, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810210/8cf17864930ab82ba20d536c79901bcb4af67830/header.jpg?t=1786807874", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810210/4fb62c95becddf68b584e6d93951ba3b08aff8c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786807874", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810210/4fb62c95becddf68b584e6d93951ba3b08aff8c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786807874", "website":